@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title SEQ-007 — Processing jobs, media and worker lease
footer APPROVED D-016 DEC-076 | UC-013, UC-014

actor Staff
participant "POI & Content" as POI
participant "Identity & Staff" as Identity
database "POI DB" as DB
participant "Provider adapter / local worker" as Processor
participant "Cloudinary" as Media
Staff -> POI: Process / retry + version + Idempotency-Key
POI -> Identity: Verify account/role/session
Identity --> POI: Context / error
POI -> DB: Save immutable input jobs + outbox
POI --> Staff: 202 job IDs / conflict
Processor -> POI: Authenticated claim
POI -> DB: Atomic exclusive lease + attempt
POI --> Processor: Snapshot + attempt + lease
loop During processing
 Processor -> POI: Renew lease
end
Processor -> Processor: Translate / synthesize capability-specific task
opt Audio result
 Processor -> POI: Request restricted upload parameters
 POI --> Processor: Signed parameters
 Processor -> Media: Upload new immutable asset
 Media --> Processor: Reference
end
Processor -> POI: Result with attempt/input version
alt Valid lease + current input + verified output
 POI -> DB: Accept once; review pending
else Stale / expired / changed input
 POI --> Processor: Reject stale result
end
opt Provider failure / quota
 POI -> DB: failed / waiting_quota; preserve good output
end
note over POI,Processor: Abandoned lease reclaim differs from Staff retry; no automatic publish

@enduml
